[{"text": "And the assembly will hear now an", "start": 1.36, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "address", "start": 3.439, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "uh by her excellency", "start": 5.279, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Netbo Nandi Dva,", "start": 8.4, "duration": 9.84}, {"text": "President of the Republic of Namibia.", "start": 12.719, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "I request the protocol to escort her", "start": 18.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "excellency and invite her to address the", "start": 21.039, "duration": 5.961}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 24.0, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Your Excellency President of the General", "start": 48.32, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Assembly,", "start": 50.879, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "I congratulate you, Mr. President,", "start": 53.039, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "on your election as the president of the", "start": 56.879, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "81st session of the General Assembly.", "start": 60.879, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "I also thank the president of the eth", "start": 65.04, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "session of the general assembly for her", "start": 67.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "commendable leadership.", "start": 71.119, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Mr. President, confidence in the", "start": 73.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "international system", "start": 76.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "is increasingly declining.", "start": 79.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "International organizations are", "start": 82.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "grappling with reduced capacity.", "start": 85.28, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "Political and economic impunity is being", "start": 88.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "entrenched.", "start": 92.799, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "The UN charter underscores", "start": 94.799, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "resolving international dispute through", "start": 98.079, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "peaceful means", "start": 101.36, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "and the obligation of state to pursue", "start": 103.439, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "diplomatic solution before resorting to", "start": 106.479, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "escalation", "start": 110.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "or the use of force.", "start": 112.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Notwithstanding, we continue to be", "start": 115.04, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "intended with image of suffering of", "start": 117.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "innocent civilians", "start": 120.88, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "such as in Sudan and eastern DRC,", "start": 123.2, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "larger scale internal displacement,", "start": 128.239, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "crossber migration", "start": 131.84, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and humanitarian crisis across the", "start": 134.319, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "world.", "start": 137.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Those conflicts continue to undermine", "start": 139.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "international mechanism", "start": 142.959, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and the structures established", "start": 145.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "to maintain international peace and", "start": 148.319, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "security.", "start": 151.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Hence we commend you Mr. President for", "start": 153.44, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "the timely and befeitting theme of the", "start": 157.04, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "8th first session of the UN General", "start": 160.959, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Assembly,", "start": 164.0, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "namely", "start": 165.519, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "restoring trust, managing", "start": 167.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 170.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "a united nation that delivers for all.", "start": 171.92, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "Namibia's independence was born out of", "start": 177.2, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "international solidarity", "start": 180.56, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "and is renown as as a UN success story.", "start": 183.04, "duration": 9.119}, {"text": "This is a testimony to the effectiveness", "start": 188.159, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "of the UN.", "start": 192.159, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "Therefore,", "start": 194.4, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "we shall not be passive observers", "start": 195.92, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "to the efforts aimed at dismantling", "start": 199.04, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "or weakening the international system", "start": 202.64, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "that had saved us over eight years, a", "start": 206.08, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "bit with some shortcomings.", "start": 210.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "In this regard, we shall continue to", "start": 213.84, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "call for peace over conflict,", "start": 217.12, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "dialogue over confrontation,", "start": 221.599, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "and peaceful coexistence over tension.", "start": 224.799, "duration": 8.241}, {"text": "In restoring trust, we need to manage", "start": 229.2, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 233.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "of the United Nations Security Council", "start": 234.879, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "based on equitable representation", "start": 238.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "in its decision making process to", "start": 241.92, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "reflect contemporary geopolitical", "start": 245.36, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "realities.", "start": 248.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "The common African position", "start": 249.84, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "as articulated in the Azurina consensus", "start": 253.04, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "and the certain declaration", "start": 256.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "has also been reaffirmed", "start": 259.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "in the pe for the future which recognize", "start": 262.56, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "Africa as a special case.", "start": 266.56, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "The time has come for us to recognize", "start": 270.72, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "that we have been negotiating for too", "start": 274.56, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "long and that it is such settlement", "start": 278.08, "duration": 9.679}, {"text": "set and it's because of that", "start": 283.68, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "com problems that a rude trust in the", "start": 287.759, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "United Nations.", "start": 292.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "This fairness and justice should extend", "start": 294.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "to the participation", "start": 299.44, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "of women in decision making", "start": 301.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "including in the prevention", "start": 304.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and resolution of conflict", "start": 307.919, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "post conflict reconstruction", "start": 310.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and peace building", "start": 314.479, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "in line with the UN security council", "start": 316.8, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "resolution 1325", "start": 320.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "on women peace. and security.", "start": 322.88, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "The women peace and security agenda", "start": 326.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "has contributed positively to the", "start": 330.16, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "rehabitation,", "start": 333.52, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "reconciliation", "start": 335.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and reintegration efforts in conflict", "start": 337.44, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "affected regions", "start": 341.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "serving as a core framework for", "start": 343.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "stabilizing postconlict", "start": 346.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "situations.", "start": 349.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "This is a positive undertaking", "start": 351.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "which should be emulated", "start": 354.56, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "by other international", "start": 357.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and regional organizations", "start": 359.919, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "and nongovernmental organizations", "start": 362.56, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "that are involved in peace support", "start": 365.6, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "operation and peace building efforts.", "start": 367.919, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 372.479, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "and system", "start": 374.88, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "needs constant transformation", "start": 376.8, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "to be effective", "start": 379.759, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "as we forge ahead with the SDGs", "start": 382.08, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "reform of the United", "start": 387.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "financial architecture", "start": 390.639, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "is critical", "start": 392.8, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "to a more equitable", "start": 394.96, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "and inclusive global economic order.", "start": 397.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Such reforms", "start": 402.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "should create greater policy space and", "start": 404.24, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "access to financing", "start": 408.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "to enable countries to expand their", "start": 410.319, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "economies", "start": 413.84, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "through value addition to their nature", "start": 415.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "resources", "start": 419.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "including critical min roles for our", "start": 420.8, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "people to have full benefit of our", "start": 424.4, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "resources.", "start": 428.56, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "This will", "start": 430.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "accelerate sustainable development,", "start": 432.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "address inequality,", "start": 435.68, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "create jobs for our youth, and lift our", "start": 438.24, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "population", "start": 441.919, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "out of poverty.", "start": 443.599, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "In this context,", "start": 445.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "we welcome the creation", "start": 447.919, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "of the African credit rating agency to", "start": 450.72, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "be launched in Mauritius in October this", "start": 455.28, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "year.", "start": 458.4, "duration": 3.199}, {"text": "This development", "start": 459.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "is a building block of Africa taking", "start": 461.599, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "ownership of her development and", "start": 466.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "prosperity agenda.", "start": 469.759, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "It demonstrates progress in Africa's", "start": 472.08, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "ambitions", "start": 476.16, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "to drive impetus", "start": 477.759, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "for the reform of the international", "start": 480.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "financial architecture", "start": 482.479, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "in order to ensure a level playing", "start": 484.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "field.", "start": 488.319, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Middle income countries", "start": 490.24, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "continue to face a high borrowing cost,", "start": 492.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "limited fiscal space,", "start": 496.4, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "debt vulnerabilities,", "start": 499.12, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "climate related shocks, and persistent", "start": 501.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "inequality.", "start": 505.599, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Namibia reaffirms", "start": 507.68, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "the civil commitment", "start": 510.4, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "as an important step towards reforming", "start": 513.039, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the international financial architecture", "start": 516.719, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "and the strengthening", "start": 519.919, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "the global partnership", "start": 522.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "for sustainable development.", "start": 524.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "The system must thus become more", "start": 527.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "inclusive,", "start": 530.8, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "equitable,", "start": 532.48, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "and responsive", "start": 534.08, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "to the realities", "start": 535.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of the middle income countries.", "start": 537.92, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 542.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "the world is experiencing", "start": 544.32, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "increasing devast devastating floods,", "start": 547.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "heat waves,", "start": 551.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "frequent hulcans and prolonged period of", "start": 553.2, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "drought. At times it feels that we are", "start": 556.8, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "at a war with mother nature.", "start": 562.16, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "At this point, Namibia reiterate it", "start": 565.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "solidarity", "start": 569.68, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "with the government", "start": 571.2, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and people of Nepal following the recent", "start": 573.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "flood in that country.", "start": 577.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Namibia continues to safe to face", "start": 580.24, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "significant climatic changes as a result", "start": 584.32, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "of climate change, including recurring", "start": 588.72, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "droughts,", "start": 592.32, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "rising temperatures,", "start": 593.839, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and growing pressure on agriculture", "start": 596.08, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "and water resources.", "start": 600.399, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "Yet, Namibia contributes less than 0.01%", "start": 602.8, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "01%", "start": 608.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of the global greenhouse gas emission", "start": 610.56, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and it bears disproportionate share of", "start": 614.72, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "the impact of climate change like other", "start": 618.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "developing countries.", "start": 622.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "In the spirit of climate justice, we", "start": 625.519, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "call for a greater responsibility", "start": 629.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "by those have contributed the most to", "start": 632.0, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "the global greenhouse gas emission,", "start": 635.6, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "including through increased support for", "start": 639.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "countries that are most vulnerable to", "start": 642.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "climate impact.", "start": 645.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "It is through sustainable climate", "start": 648.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "financing that will be able to achieve", "start": 650.24, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "sustainable development goal 13 to", "start": 654.56, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "combat climate change.", "start": 658.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Against this backdrop, it's very", "start": 661.04, "duration": 8.799}, {"text": "important to focus on water in 2026,", "start": 664.16, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "particularly as climate change", "start": 669.839, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "intensifies,", "start": 671.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "drought, floods, desification,", "start": 673.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and land degragation", "start": 676.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "across Africa.", "start": 679.2, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "As an arid country, Namibia continue to", "start": 681.44, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "promote the broad use and conservation", "start": 685.279, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "of water, integrated water resource", "start": 689.519, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "management,", "start": 693.12, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "groundwater recharge", "start": 694.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "and greater investment", "start": 697.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "in sustainable water infrastructure.", "start": 699.839, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "We also underscore", "start": 704.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "the importance of the implementation", "start": 707.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "of the NAMI declaration", "start": 710.24, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "adopted at COP 11 in Winduk as part of", "start": 713.2, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "our collective response to justification", "start": 717.76, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and land degragation", "start": 722.16, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "and drought.", "start": 724.64, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "In this regard, we are pleased to inform", "start": 726.8, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "that Namibia is a host to the global", "start": 731.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "water partnership headquarters.", "start": 734.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "first a time to be located in the global", "start": 737.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "south", "start": 741.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "in our capacity", "start": 742.959, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "as co-chair", "start": 745.44, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "with sagal", "start": 747.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "of the AU international highlevel panel", "start": 749.2, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "on the African water investment program.", "start": 753.12, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "On Monday we convened a high level side", "start": 757.12, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "event on water investment for Africa and", "start": 761.04, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "the globe.", "start": 766.0, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We believe its outcome is a meaningful", "start": 767.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "contribution", "start": 771.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "to the 2026 UN water conference to be", "start": 773.44, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "held later in the year and advance", "start": 777.76, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "strong global partnership", "start": 781.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "investment and action for sustainable", "start": 783.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "water security.", "start": 787.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 789.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "the pack for the future, which was co-f", "start": 791.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "facilitated", "start": 794.959, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "by Namibia Germany,", "start": 796.959, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "provides an ambitious framework", "start": 799.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "for transforming global governancy", "start": 802.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "and addressing contemporary", "start": 806.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and emerging challenges.", "start": 809.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "While the pack gives due consideration", "start": 812.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "for the interest and the needs of the", "start": 815.279, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "future generation,", "start": 817.519, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "its implementation has not been as", "start": 819.44, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "effective as we had wished. For Namibia,", "start": 822.8, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "effective implementation", "start": 828.16, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "of the key commitment", "start": 830.56, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "of the PE for the future would be", "start": 833.12, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "beneficial", "start": 836.399, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "in accomplishing", "start": 838.079, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Namibia's national priorities,", "start": 840.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "namely agriculture,", "start": 843.44, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "sports,", "start": 846.079, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "youth empowerment,", "start": 847.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "quality education and training,", "start": 849.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "creative industry,", "start": 852.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "health and social welfare,", "start": 854.88, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "land, housing and sanitation.", "start": 857.6, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "I wish to urge all member states to", "start": 861.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "consider the implementation", "start": 865.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "of the PE for the future as a critical", "start": 868.0, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "international prior is a crucial", "start": 871.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "international priority", "start": 875.76, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "for development.", "start": 878.16, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "As part of our developmental agenda, we", "start": 880.639, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "are preparing our young people for the", "start": 884.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "emerging industries in Namibia", "start": 887.76, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "such as oil and gas, renewable energy", "start": 891.12, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "and green hydrogen", "start": 895.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "among others.", "start": 898.399, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "Subsequently", "start": 900.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "this year we have introduced", "start": 902.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "100% subsidized", "start": 905.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "registration", "start": 909.199, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "and tuition fees for Namibian students", "start": 911.04, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "entering universities", "start": 915.6, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "and vocational training centers and", "start": 918.0, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "encourage them to take up appropriate", "start": 921.519, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "courses.", "start": 925.04, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "The government of Namibia has", "start": 926.8, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "established", "start": 928.8, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "the National Youth Development Fund last", "start": 930.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "year. As a result of this fund, young", "start": 932.88, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "people have set up their own medical", "start": 937.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "practice, law firms,", "start": 939.76, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "milling plants, pottery business to", "start": 942.88, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "mention a few. Thus contributing to job", "start": 946.959, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "creation and poverty eradication.", "start": 951.04, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Namibia also takes cognition", "start": 955.279, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "of the rapid advancement", "start": 958.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "artificial intelligence", "start": 961.199, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "in advancing human progress", "start": 963.68, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "in line with the global digital compact.", "start": 966.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "However,", "start": 970.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "we call for ethical,", "start": 972.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "responsible,", "start": 974.48, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "inclusive", "start": 976.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and human centered development", "start": 977.92, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "and you and use of artificial", "start": 981.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "intelligency", "start": 983.759, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "with appropriate safeguard to ensure", "start": 985.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "that technological advancement", "start": 988.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "complements", "start": 991.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and enhance human capability", "start": 993.36, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "rather than undermine it. A united", "start": 996.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "nations", "start": 1000.8, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "that delivers for all must be inclusive.", "start": 1002.32, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "I reaffirm", "start": 1007.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "Namibia's unwavering solidarity", "start": 1009.199, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "with people denied", "start": 1012.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "their right to self-determination.", "start": 1015.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "This position is firmly rooted in", "start": 1018.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Namibia's historical experience", "start": 1022.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "of the brutality", "start": 1025.12, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "and colonialism,", "start": 1027.36, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "aparate", "start": 1029.439, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "and occupation.", "start": 1030.959, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "This is not a position", "start": 1033.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "born out of antagonism,", "start": 1036.319, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "but rather", "start": 1039.52, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "one grounded in Namibia's longstanding", "start": 1041.52, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "commitment to justice, solidarity,", "start": 1044.959, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "and the rights of the peoples to", "start": 1050.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "determine their own destiny in", "start": 1053.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "accordance with UN General Assembly", "start": 1055.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Resolution", "start": 1059.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "1514.", "start": 1060.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "of 1960.", "start": 1062.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "The United Nations", "start": 1065.12, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "has a responsibility", "start": 1067.52, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "to advance a just and lasting resolution", "start": 1069.919, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "of the question of Western Sahara", "start": 1075.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "constant with the chapter the charter of", "start": 1078.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "the United Nations and the relevant", "start": 1082.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "resolution on decolonization", "start": 1085.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and self-determination.", "start": 1088.96, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "We support minerals mandate and the", "start": 1091.6, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "holding of a UNbacked referendum in", "start": 1096.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Western Sahara for the Western Sahara", "start": 1100.16, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "people to finally exercise their right", "start": 1103.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "to self-determination.", "start": 1106.799, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "We therefore call upon the full", "start": 1109.36, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "implementation", "start": 1112.4, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "of the UN Security Council resolution", "start": 1114.08, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "2797 of October 2025", "start": 1117.919, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "which reaffirm the need for immortal", "start": 1122.08, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "agreeable lasting political solution", "start": 1125.919, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "between the Polario and the Kingdom of", "start": 1129.679, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Morocco. Namibia calls for the", "start": 1133.039, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "Palestine's people's right to", "start": 1137.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "self-determination,", "start": 1139.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "freedom, and statethood. We further call", "start": 1141.84, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "for an end to the atrocities being", "start": 1145.28, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "committed in Gaza. The establishment of", "start": 1148.32, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "an independent Palestine state, living", "start": 1152.48, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "side by side with Israel in peace and", "start": 1155.76, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "security remains a vital goal that we", "start": 1159.52, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "must collectively pursue.", "start": 1163.919, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "We call for the lifting of the", "start": 1166.64, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "unjustified economic embargo against", "start": 1169.84, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "Cuba, which had farreaching consequences", "start": 1173.44, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "for the Cuban economy and the well-being", "start": 1178.0, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "of people, including access to essential", "start": 1181.36, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "goods and services. We call for the end", "start": 1185.919, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "to the energy siege on Cuba and her", "start": 1190.16, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "removal from the unilateral", "start": 1193.919, "duration": 9.601}, {"text": "list of state allegedly sponsoring", "start": 1199.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "terrorism", "start": 1203.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "from outgoing and in the spirit of the", "start": 1205.36, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "charter for a united nation that deliver", "start": 1209.12, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "for all. The UN has a responsibility", "start": 1213.679, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "to protect and facilitate the", "start": 1217.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "participation of its all members and", "start": 1220.88, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "observers in its work. Mr. President,", "start": 1223.28, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "the adoption of the United Nation", "start": 1228.799, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "resolution", "start": 1232.0, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "on the transatlantic", "start": 1233.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "slave trade in March 2026", "start": 1235.84, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "is the beginning of a journey. A journey", "start": 1240.24, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "towards truth, acknowledgment,", "start": 1243.6, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "healing and justice for millions of", "start": 1247.679, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "Africans and people of African descent", "start": 1251.12, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "whose lives were forever changed by", "start": 1255.28, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "slavery, colonialism", "start": 1258.64, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "and other historical injustice.", "start": 1261.6, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "As we commemorate the 25th anniversary", "start": 1265.36, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "of the Deben declaration and program of", "start": 1269.2, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "action, we are reminded that racial", "start": 1272.799, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "discrimination", "start": 1275.919, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "must not have any place in our societies", "start": 1277.52, "duration": 9.039}, {"text": "and that restorative remedies including", "start": 1282.24, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "reparation must be put in place to", "start": 1286.559, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "address those historic injustice.", "start": 1290.4, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Mr. President Namibia congratulate", "start": 1293.52, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "the outgoing secretary general Mr.", "start": 1297.84, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Antonio Gutesi as he nears the end of", "start": 1301.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "his tenure. We commend him for", "start": 1304.96, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "overseeing the largest part of the", "start": 1307.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "implementation of the United Nations", "start": 1311.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "sustainable development goals that have", "start": 1314.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "energized international support", "start": 1317.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "including the actions in the pack for", "start": 1320.24, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "the future. Namibia stand ready to work", "start": 1323.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "with the incoming secretary general.", "start": 1327.52, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "However,", "start": 1330.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "let me point out that since the", "start": 1332.64, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "establishment", "start": 1336.0, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "of the United Nations in 1945,", "start": 1337.679, "duration": 9.681}, {"text": "no woman has served a secretary general", "start": 1342.96, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "of the organization.", "start": 1347.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "The leadership of the organization", "start": 1349.679, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "has yet to reflect the principle of", "start": 1352.72, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "gender equality that is promote pro", "start": 1356.08, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "which is being promoted across the", "start": 1360.799, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "international system. Namibia therefore", "start": 1364.08, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "believes that it's time that a woman is", "start": 1367.44, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "elected as secretary general of our", "start": 1372.159, "duration": 7.081}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 1376.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President, the United Nation is the", "start": 1381.52, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "only platform", "start": 1386.48, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "through which all nations can", "start": 1388.48, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "collectively advance shared aspiration,", "start": 1391.84, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "achieve common goals and address global", "start": 1396.32, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "challenges. Namibia will remain a", "start": 1400.159, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "constructive partner in strengthening", "start": 1404.08, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "materalism cooperation in restoring", "start": 1407.44, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "trust in the United Nations. Let us", "start": 1410.799, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "therefore continue to defend our", "start": 1415.28, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 1418.4, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Let us collectively", "start": 1420.159, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "place human dignity at the center of the", "start": 1422.4, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "United Nations", "start": 1427.039, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "so as to restore trust,", "start": 1429.12, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "effectively manage transformation", "start": 1432.08, "duration": 9.64}, {"text": "and deliver for all. I thank you.", "start": 1435.919, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1442.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "thank uh the president of the Republic", "start": 1444.96, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of Namibia.", "start": 1447.6, "duration": 2.8}]